  "$comment": "SimpleAtom's request contract and model registry: the single source of truth for what the backend accepts. mace-api/contract.py enforces it (the security boundary); scripts/gen-contract.mjs generates lib/generated/contract.ts from it for the UI and the Next.js route mirrors. Edit this file, then run `npm run gen:contract`. CI fails if the generated file is stale. See docs/adr/0021 and 0022.",
